+        "constraints and applies Kahn topological sorting in O(c+n^2) time; at "
+        "the shipping preset it scans 1,553 compressed twin classes, takes about "
+        "4,500 counted primitive operations and under 0.01 seconds, while the "
+        "compact modular route uses 192 exact arithmetic operations and is not "
